# Auto-detect text files and normalize their line endings to LF in the
# repository. Git converts to the platform's native line ending on checkout
# (CRLF on Windows) according to core.autocrlf.
* text=auto

# Explicitly mark known binary assets so they are never subject to line
# ending conversion, regardless of git's content-based heuristics.
*.ico binary
*.rom binary
*.szx binary
*.wasm binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.db binary
